          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Empty, rinse and refill it every day it runs, and do a full descale and disinfect at least once a week. The EPA's guidance suggests cleaning portable humidifiers every third day, which is a good target for households with asthma, allergies or very hard water. Always follow the cleaning interval in your manual if it is stricter."
