            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes. Undiluted white vinegar is the standard way to remove mineral scale from tanks, bases, ultrasonic transducers and warm-mist heating chambers. Let it sit for 20 to 30 minutes, scrub, then rinse thoroughly. Vinegar descales but is not a reliable disinfectant on its own, so follow it with a separate disinfecting step after rinsing."
